(
    title: "Bonk\'s Revenge",
    description: Some("Bonk head-butts his way through another side-scrolling adventure, and every slab of meat now spins a roulette through three transformations for you to stop on. Master Bonk hits and jumps harder, Hungry Bonk bites enemies for more damage than a head-butt, and Stealth Bonk trades the ground-slam for entry to the game\'s many secret rooms."),
